  "description": "<p>The following note incorrectly suggests that an unimplemented feature is in fact implemented:</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nNote: All fcrepo 3 DC (Dublin Core) datastream values are mapped as dcterms properties on the <span class=\"code-object\">Object</span> in fcrepo 6+. The same goes <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> any properties in the RELS-EXT and RELS-INT datastreams.\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>It should be removed until it is actually implemented.</p>",
